pairm:pair-ai-risk-to-control-embedding a sssom:MappingSet ;
    rdfs:label "OWASP risk to MIT control family, embedding-derived"@en ;
    dct:source "PAIR-AI risk-to-mitigation CSV 'Final_Mapped_Taxonomy_Table_Output' (OWASP -> IBM -> MIT-action embedding mapping), applied 2026-07-17. Method per its own reference doc: embedding-matched, cosine top-3, unvalidated. Covers LLM01-06 and LLM09 only. Known defects carried from the source: action A0973 filed under sub-category 2.3 but tagged Category 3; capitalization drift; references 19 IBM risks this project does not declare. NOT PRESENT IN THIS REPOSITORY - these mappings cannot currently be re-derived or independently checked."@en ;
    dct:description "NOT validated. These links were produced without human adjudication of each row; treat as a baseline pending review, not as curated correspondences."@en ;
    sssom:mapping_tool "pair-ai" .

